  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Research and Policy Integration for Development (RAPID) to develop expertise and advocate for policy action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO funding will support RAPID to undertake policy research and advocacy and provide technical expertise to policymakers on trade economics. RAPID will also develop its organisational capabilities to become more effective as a think tank. It will recruit and train staff and develop communication and advocacy skills.</narrative>
  </description>
